0..72 Comment "// A frame-region buffer orphaned: abandoning a task whose stack holds a"
73..147 Comment "// pending completion may hand the completion, buffer inside, to a reactor"
148..225 Comment "// that reaps it later (boats, _Notes on io-uring_, 2020). That is sound only"
226..296 Comment "// for a buffer the reactor\'s region outlives, never one living in the"
297..316 Comment "// abandoned frame."
317..319 Comment "//"
320..356 Comment "// - see: #1183 — `bufferOrphaned`"
358..397 Comment "// The ring\'s protocol and its entries."
398..404 Keyword "import"
405..406 StringLit "\""
406..444 StringLit "../../model/completion/ring-base.gandr"
444..445 StringLit "\""
445..446 Other ";"
448..519 Comment "/// A pending completion handed to a reaping peer while its frame ends."
520..598 Comment "/// Delegation admits the handover, and nothing ties the buffer to a region. A"
599..672 Comment "/// kernel handed a buffer kept in a hold\'s region is refused where it is"
673..748 Comment "/// forked, since no region bounds a forked peer (`region-ended.gandr`), so"
749..816 Comment "/// this checks until a kernel can be bounded by the buffer\'s hold,"
817..878 Comment "/// when a reaper that outlives the hold becomes the refusal."
879..882 Keyword "def"
883..897 FunctionDef "bufferOrphaned"
